    " · You": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · You"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · 你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "## Your projects\n\nProjects bring together the Memory your team uses. When someone adds you to a project, it appears in your project list.\n\n## Work with Memory\n\nOpen a project to browse its Memory. Your edits stay in Drafts until they are reviewed and published.\n\n## Stay informed\n\nInbox tells you about Reviews, remote updates to Memory your projects use, and changes to your access. Your everyday Draft edits do not create notifications.\n\nIf you do not have a project yet, ask a project administrator to add you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "## Your projects\n\nProjects bring together the Memory your team uses. When someone adds you to a project, it appears in your project list.\n\n## Work with Memory\n\nOpen a project to browse its Memory. Your edits stay in Drafts until they are reviewed and published.\n\n## Stay informed\n\nInbox tells you about Reviews, remote updates to Memory your projects use, and changes to your access. Your everyday Draft edits do not create notifications.\n\nIf you do not have a project yet, ask a project administrator to add you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "## 你的项目\n\n项目汇集了团队使用的 Memory。有人将你加入项目后，你就能在项目列表中找到它。\n\n## 使用 Memory\n\n打开项目即可浏览其中的 Memory。你的编辑会保留为草稿，经过评审和发布后才会更新远程内容。\n\n## 关注团队动态\n\n收件箱会通知你评审动态、项目所用 Memory 的远程更新，以及你的访问权限变更。日常编辑草稿不会产生通知。\n\n如果你还没有项目，可以请项目管理员将你加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
