    "Clumsies is running from a temporary macOS App Translocation path. Quit the App, move Clumsies.app to /Applications or ~/Applications, then open it again. No daemon or Agent integration was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
