    "Each current document appears once, according to its most recent observed retrieval within 90 days. Without complete history, a missing record is labelled Not observed. Low frequency alone is not evidence that a memory should be deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each current document appears once, according to its most recent observed retrieval within 90 days. Without complete history, a missing record is labelled Not observed. Low frequency alone is not evidence that a memory should be deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每份当前文档只计一次，按 90 天内最近一次观测到的检索分类。历史不完整时，缺失的记录标为“未观测到”。使用频率低本身不代表应该删除该记忆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
