          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端版本已更改。请关闭此窗口，重新检查最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rename is saved as a draft. After review and merge, the file will be renamed in every project that includes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rename is saved as a draft. After review and merge, the file will be renamed in every project that includes it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名会保存为草稿。评审并合并后，所有包含此文件的项目都会使用新名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request couldn't be accepted. Check the information you entered before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request couldn't be accepted. Check the information you entered before trying again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求未被接受。请检查填写的信息后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The resident daemon rejected the bundled Agent runtime. Archived integration inspection was skipped. Reinstall and restart Clumsies so the App and daemon use the same build. To replace the resident Debug installation, run just install-macos; distributed Release builds must use an accepted release signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The resident daemon rejected the bundled Agent runtime. Archived integration inspection was skipped. Reinstall and restart Clumsies so the App and daemon use the same build. To replace the resident Debug installation, run just install-macos; distributed Release builds must use an accepted release signature."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驻留守护进程拒绝了应用内置的智能体运行时，已跳过旧集成检查。请重新安装并启动 Clumsies，使应用和守护进程使用同一构建版本。替换本机调试版时请运行 just install-macos；发布版必须使用受认可的发布签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected Bundle contains memory that is not available in the Organization.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected Bundle contains memory that is not available in the Organization."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选 Bundle 包含组织中不可用的记忆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected Bundle is no longer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected Bundle is no longer available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选 Bundle 已不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected Project is no longer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected Project is no longer available."
          }
