          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server calculates daily closing inventory from published commits. Project scope includes selected organization memories; selection changes affect its count. Draft overlays are excluded. Days before the first retained commit remain unknown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server calculates daily closing inventory from published commits. Project scope includes selected organization memories; selection changes affect its count. Draft overlays are excluded. Days before the first retained commit remain unknown."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器根据已发布的提交计算每日结束时的记忆总量。项目范围包含已选中的组织记忆，调整选择会影响数量。不包含草稿覆盖的内容。最早保留的提交之前的日期显示为未知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server compares consecutive published snapshots, including project selection changes. Distinct document IDs added, updated or deleted are grouped by day or consecutive seven-day buckets. A document can appear in several buckets, so bucket totals may exceed the period's distinct count. Draft autosaves are excluded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server compares consecutive published snapshots, including project selection changes. Distinct document IDs added, updated or deleted are grouped by day or consecutive seven-day buckets. A document can appear in several buckets, so bucket totals may exceed the period's distinct count. Draft autosaves are excluded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器比较相邻的已发布快照，包括项目记忆选择的变化。新增、修改或删除的不同文档按天或连续的七天分组。同一文档可能出现在多个分组中，因此分组总和可能超过整个时间范围内的不同文档数。不包含草稿自动保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is busy. Wait a moment before trying again.": {
